{"unit_id":"OpenSaozi__dsh-bigmodel-catalog#card-zh","repo":"OpenSaozi/dsh-bigmodel-catalog","commit":"b54922c06bb7ba8e96f30c396b1d7279df351fdf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"BigModel GLM Provider 把智谱 BigModel Coding Plan 注册为 DSH 的 zai 模型路由，并按服务端在线列表筛选 GLM 型号。插件维护 GLM-4.5、4.6、5 及 GLM-5.3 系列，其中 GLM-5.3 Flash 支持图片输入。它会在凭据更新时刷新目录，并为模型请求配置 Coding Plan 接口格式。适合希望在 DSH 使用智谱编程模型或图文模型的开发者。需要 BigModel 账号，并在 DSH 凭据服务设置 BIGMODEL_API_KEY。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:154-164","src/index.ts:211-214","src/index.ts:272-309"]}
